    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>You can now utilize&nbsp;public IP tags on node public IPs to utilize the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-network/ip-services/routing-preference-overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure Routing Preference</a>&nbsp;feature.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/%20azure/aks/use-node-public-ips%23use-public-ip-tags-on-node-public-ips\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more.</a></p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "You can now utilize public IP tags on node public IPs to utilize the Azure Routing Preference feature.\n\nLearn more."
  },
